+| EXP-003 | `whatsapp_cta` | `/join/grower` + growers section | form only → form + "Chat on WhatsApp" secondary button (`wa.me` link with prefilled message) | grower lead = `join_form_submit` OR `whatsapp_click` | ⛔ WhatsApp number |
