-// src/lib/auth.ts
-// Use next-auth v5 with Prisma adapter
-// Session includes: id, email, name, role, image
-// Role-based middleware in src/middleware.ts
-
-PROTECTED ROUTES:
-  /grower/*     → requires role: GROWER
-  /restaurant/* → requires role: RESTAURANT
-  /admin/*      → requires role: ADMIN
-
-MIDDLEWARE (src/middleware.ts):
-  - Check session on all /(dashboard)/* routes
-  - Redirect to /login if no session
-  - Redirect to role-appropriate dashboard on wrong role access
