-     - Calculate yield accuracy: actualYieldGrams / (trayCount * 200)
-     - Create Payout record: amount = trayCount * PRICE_PER_TRAY (configurable, default ₹50/tray)
-     - Update Grower scores (recalculate rolling average of last 10 batches)
