-     - qualityScore = passedBatches / totalBatches over last 20 batches
-     - timelinessScore = batches submitted on time / total batches
-     - compositeScore = (yieldScore * 0.4) + (qualityScore * 0.4) + (timelinessScore * 0.2)
-     - Update Grower record
